","\"median60_traded_value\"","\"zero_trade_days_verified\"","\"primary_missing_attempt\"","\"spread\"","\"depth\"","\"current_ASM_GSM\"","\"current_circuit_status\"","\"historical_listing\"","\"G4\"","\"2026-10-19\"","\"98.4\"","\"Secondary rounded close, not verified executable BSE close\"","\"https://www.screener.in/company/544804/\"","\"19 Oct close\"","\"500000\"","\".01\"","\".03\"","\".02\"","\".05\"","\".10\"","null","\"BSE historical/bhavcopy endpoint returned403. Missing bars are ND, never zero. NSE interoperability master verifies identity/lot but is not BSE volume.\"","\"Initial10tradingdays trade-for-trade; BSE20260701-2 stated transition to M rolling15July. Do not infer current segment from initial notice.\"","\"Hold—unresolved\"","\"edition\"","\"sha256\"","\"cutoff\"","\"market_date\"","\"rounding\"","\"weights\"","\"hurdle\"","\"missing\"","\"3.0\"","\"68d4de4255427df276318d0231530b867a453e740c74150e9768bf1387224137\"","\"2026-10-20 Asia/Kolkata\"","\"Decimal, precision 36, ROUND_HALF_UP, display one decimal; reuse unrounded final BQS\"","\"BQS\"","\"GQS\"","\"IAS\"","\"GOV\"","\"MOAT\"","\"REV\"","\"DUR\"","\"CAP\"","\"CASH\"","\"BAL\"","\"EXEC\"","\".20\"","\".12\"","\".08\"","\"EARN\"","\".40\"","\".15\"","\"R\"","\"D\"","\"P\"","\"L\"","\".25\"","\".35\"","\"NS for scores; ND unavailable facts; NM economically meaningless; NA genuinely inapplicable. Never renormalize.\"","\"boundary_sensitivity\"","\"terms\"","\"known_contribution\"","\"coverage\"","\"missing_weight\"","\"uncapped_bound\"","\"cap\"","\"effective_bound\"","\"unrounded_raw\"","\"unrounded_final\"","\"display\"","\"factor\"","\"score\"","\"weight\"","\"contribution\"","\"4\"","\"0.20\"","\"0.80\"","\"7\"","\"0.12\"","\"0.84\"","\"0.10\"","\"0.50\"","\"0.08\"","\"0.32\"","\"3.46\"","\"3.66\"","\"5.46\"","\"NS\"","\"0.40\"","\"2.80\"","\"1.00\"","\"0.15\"","\"4.00\"","\"0.70\"","\"0.30\"","\"4.30\"","\"7.00\"","\"nested_information_bound\"","\"0.25\"","\"0.35\"","\"0.00\"","\"10.00\"","\"1.6650\"","\"8.8650\"","\"GOV3\"","\"GOV5\"","\"hypothetical_actual_G3_failure\"","\"3\"","\"0.60\"","\"3.26\"","\"5.26\"","\"1.50\"","\"8.25\"","\"3.86\"","\"5.66\"","\"1.7150\"","\"8.9150\"","\"factors\"","\"gates\"","\"override\"","\"classification\"","\"supporting_facts\"","\"contrary_fact\"","\"confidence\"","\"status\"","4","\"Promoters hold 7,885,428 shares after the IPO, approximately 73.39% of issued shares.\"","\"FY24 audit-trail absence and FY25 contradictory wording accompany recurring bank-to-book reconciliation gaps.\"","\"Main and IFC opinions are unmodified; no fraud or default is established, and the changed IPO objects were approved.\"","\"AR2024\"","\"AR2025\"","\"AR26_BSE\"","\"VOTE\"","\"Medium\"","\"scored\"","\"Six disclosed stores total about 25,900 square feet and remain geographically concentrated.\"","\"Design and customization support a local franchise, but supplier exclusivity and audited customer-cohort advantages are not established.\"","\"Premium product mix and sales growth are positive, but do not establish a national moat.\"","\"RHP\"","7","\"Revenue rose from ₹20.9349cr in FY23 to ₹33.3746cr in FY26, with no acquired operating business identified.\"","\"Annual growth was 9.27%, 8.43% and 34.55%; the FY22 incorporation stub is excluded.\"","\"Price, volume and audited same-store growth are unavailable; new Mumbai capacity and a short comparable history matter.\"","5","\"Wedding and festival demand recurs across men’s and women’s categories.\"","\"Gujarat accounted for 96.59% of FY25 revenue and 67.13% in the January 2026 period.\"","\"Revenue is not contracted; discretionary demand and regional fashion preferences can change.\"","\"POSTAL\"","\"PPE rose from ₹0.2927cr to ₹31.8852cr in FY26; inventory rose from ₹21.4027cr to ₹41.0462cr.\"","\"The new ₹15.5cr property and ₹19.2395cr comparable fitout/deposit plan require evidence of incremental returns.\"","\"Revenue and EBITDA grew, but commissioning dates, cohort returns and inventory reliability are insufficiently established.\"","\"PROPERTY\"","\"Low\"","2","\"Cumulative FY23–FY26 CFO is negative despite positive cumulative PAT; the calculation is a ratio of sums.\"","\"FY26 CFO was −₹3.1932cr before ₹3.0759cr finance cash; inventory absorbed ₹19.6435cr while payables provided ₹10.4128cr.\"","\"FY25 CFO was positive, but capital-advance and tax/provision classifications affect its interpretation.\"","\"At 31 March, gross debt was ₹41.3623cr, cash ₹0.1279cr and equity ₹18.2762cr.\"","\"The IPO was followed by property and revised store commitments; current usable facilities and cash are unavailable.\"","\"The IPO supplied capital and no default is reported, but gross proceeds cannot be assumed still available.\"","\"Five stores through FY25 became six in FY26, including Mumbai.\"","\"Two of four IPO locations changed soon after listing, with a larger comparable budget and extended deadline.\"","\"New-store sales grew and shareholders approved the change; the revised plan may be sensible, but returns remain unproven.\"","\"Core EBITDA adds all finance costs and depreciation, then removes other income.\"","\"Inventory verification and bank reconciliation gaps affect the reliability of reported earnings.\"","\"The main opinion is unmodified; an inventory adjustment cannot be quantified reliably and is not invented.\"","\"Cash-linked returns are conditional simulations rather than a verified funded base case.\"","\"The rounded secondary price and unavailable October cash/debt prevent a scoreable expected return.\"","\"Bounded return and financing tests are supplied, but do not repair the unresolved gates.\"","\"PRICE\"","\"Inventory markdowns and withdrawal of supplier or bank credit could impair equity.\"","\"Recovery values and downside probabilities cannot be established from current evidence.\"","\"Owned property and the brand may have value, but independent liquidation valuations are unavailable.\"","\"Current-share P/E is calculated conditionally from the secondary price and primary share count.\"","\"A reliable margin of safety cannot be established while accounting and funding evidence are unresolved.\"","\"Headline valuation is not extreme against some peers, but scale, leases and quality differ materially.\"","\"PEERMARKET\"","\"The reference position is ₹5 lakh and the verified lot is 1,200 shares.\"","\"Complete BSE 20/60-session mean and median traded values, spread, depth and current restrictions are unavailable.\"","\"The security master verifies identity and lot size, not executable trading capacity.\"","\"SECURITY\"","\"G1\"","\"G2\"","\"G3\"","\"reason\"","\"Conditional\"","\"Family control and disclosure weaknesses require caution, but substantiated fraud or siphoning is not established.\"","\"FY26 inventory verification is limited and bank-to-book mismatches recur. Material balances remain unreconciled.\"","\"Current cash, usable facilities, maturity schedules and expanded-project funding are not verified. A model failure is not an actual default.\"","\"Complete BSE traded-value history, spread and depth are unavailable at the stated position size.\"","\"Persistent CASH2 caps GQS at5. Missing scores remain NS. Actual G1/G3 failure caps are not invoked; hypothetical boundary cases are tested separately.\"","\"Hold, unresolved accounting, funding and tradability. Not eligible for an investable ranking or compounder designation.\"","\"units\"","\"years\"","\"primary_series\"","\"original_vintages\"","\"cash_bridge_FY26\"","\"capital_reconciliation\"","\"operating_capital_definition\"","\"operating_adjustments\"","\"limitations\"","\"original_vintages_complete\"","\"original_vintage_qualifiers\"","\"INR crore, unless noted\"","\"FY23\"","\"FY24\"","\"FY25\"","\"FY26\"","\"revenue\"","\"other_income\"","\"pbt\"","\"finance\"","\"depreciation\"","\"pat\"","\"cfo\"","\"capex\"","\"cash\"","\"inventory\"","\"receivables\"","\"payables\"","\"advances\"","\"other_ca\"","\"ppe\"","\"other_nca