"1.229863429074805390926033570\"","\"4.2\"","\"12.47\"","\"17.2973\"","\"1.9422\"","\"5.5486\"","20","\"All forward inputs are analyst assumptions, not guidance or verified October accounts.\"","\"Ordinary cases allow zero unverified new credit. Separate capped ₹20cr, ₹25cr and ₹30cr pre-entry bridge diagnostics charge a2% fee, scenario interest and full repayment on19 October2028. None is verified. Lower-cap failed paths remain retained.\"","\"IPO cash enters on 1 July, split between restricted store, working-capital and general-purpose pools. Release requires matched contemporaneous cash uses. Previously paid IPO fees are reimbursed once.\"","\"Full reported working-capital and general-purpose utilization is enforced on1 September. Unmatched uses are released against an equal explicit cash outflow, never free cash. The resulting memorandum deployed-capital balance is not asserted to be an audited recoverable asset; it is included in capital employed with zero separate terminal recovery. The original timing/allocation residual remains visible.\"","\"Property payment on 22 September is an assumption based on the sale-certificate date. Earlier payment is tested. Property ₹15.5cr is separate from fitout ₹17.2973cr and deposits ₹1.9422cr. Annual Ahmedabad rent ₹1.5732cr is excluded from capex because margins already include rent.\"","\"Operating balances interpolate from 31 March to the entry target. Inventory intensity converges over five years, not through an immediate unexplained release. A writeoff is noncash initially; any subsequent replacement inventory consumes cash.\"","\"Debt service uses disclosed first-year current maturity and an assumed four-year runoff thereafter. Cash credit is repaid on the stated scenario date, not automatically rolled over. Actual contracts and renewals are unavailable.\"","\"Normalized tax is 25% of positive earnings after interest. No cash benefit is credited on losses. Margins include rent under Indian AS.\"","\"Terminal productive-capital ROIC excludes cash; reserve growth is separately retained. Required productive reinvestment is the greater of explicit capital-intensity growth and NOPAT times growth divided by the conservative productive-ROIC ceiling.\"","\"The terminal cash reserve is one month of annual revenue plus the cash floor. It must cover forward operating timing deficits. Reserve growth is deducted from FCFF and internally retained in the forward year. No new terminal financing is allowed.\"","\"No dividends are assumed. Retained cash is counted only once after the required reserve. Any pre-entry, holding, intraperiod or terminal liquidity breach suppresses ordinary returns.\"","\"Equity rescue is whole-share, discounted and fee-adjusted, bounded by authorized capital. Authorization is not evidence of subscription or issue approval. Adjacent failed-share paths are retained.\"","\"Opening current-tax liability ₹2.1289cr is paid gross on 30 June 2026, a conservative timing assumption. The excluded ₹0.1961cr advance-tax asset receives no recovery or terminal value without matched-offset evidence. A disputed ₹1.1812cr payment is a separate stress.\"","\"The full IPO fee budget is deducted at listing as conservative early cash payment/reservation. The postal notice reported ₹3.2764cr spent and ₹0.9236cr still unspent within the ₹4.2cr fee allocation; this remainder is not treated as free project or shareholder cash.\"","\"peers\"","\"comparability\"","\"Use PAT/current share P/E and raw CFO/PAT with lease/capex bridge; no lease-adjusted EV/EBITDA claim without full harmonization. Peer market records are official19October, Riyaasat quote secondary. No median multiple automatically applied.\"","\"source_url\"","\"source_sha256\"","\"rows\"","\"security_master_rows\"","\"security_master_url\"","\"security_master_sha256\"","\"denominator_caution\"","\"TradDt\"","\"BizDt\"","\"Src\"","\"XpryDt\"","\"FininstrmActlXpryDt\"","\"StrkPric\"","\"OptnTp\"","\"OpnPric\"","\"HghPric\"","\"LwPric\